      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm. Again, the operating system isn\u0027t necessarily doing all of this.\n\nYou\u0027re describing a \"TCPM\" or a Type-C Port Manager. In the case of our EC based systems on Chrome OS, that does not live in the AP hosted OS, but in our EC.\n\nOur OS\u0027s kernel and userspace pieces are taking on more responsibility for higher level policy decisions, but not all of it just yet.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 20,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 20,
        "endChar": 25
      },
      "revId": "c7b0b7f2e6a0c464cab0f2280fe775ffd556fc08",
